# ⏱️ Stopwatch

A simple and responsive **Stopwatch** built using **HTML**, **CSS**, and **JavaScript**. The stopwatch allows users to start, stop, and reset the timer with an intuitive interface.

## ✨ Features

- ▶️ Start the stopwatch
- ⏸️ Stop/Pause the stopwatch
- 🔄 Reset the stopwatch
- ⏱️ Displays minutes, seconds, and milliseconds
- ⚡ Real-time updates using `setInterval()`
- 📱 Responsive design

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript (ES6)

## 📚 Concepts Practiced

- DOM Manipulation
- Event Handling
- Functions
- Variables
- `setInterval()`
- `clearInterval()`
- `Date.now()`
- Template Literals
- `Math.floor()`
- `padStart()`

## 🚀 How to Run

1. Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/swastikakarmakar13-bot/Stopwatch-Program.git
```

2. Open the project folder.

3. Open `index.html` in your browser.

## 📸 Preview

```text
📷 images/stopwatch.png
```

